title: "ThesisAnalysisOS: what still holds?"
abstract: >-
  An operating layer for scientific research done with AI agents. Every
  result an agent records is kept with what it stood on, so that later the
  system can say whether it still holds, and why.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bennett
    given-names: Justin
